## Summary

Make school-scoped raw staff identity reads follow the target staff member's effective placement period.

Previously `app_private.can_read_staff_identity(...)` allowed a school user to read a target staff identity if that target had any assignment or membership row for a school the viewer could access. Historical and future target placements therefore counted as current school identity authority.

This change keeps Platform Admin and self-read behavior unchanged, while requiring school-scoped target assignments/memberships to be effective today.

## Regression coverage

- current target placement remains visible to an authorized school viewer;
- former target placement is no longer visible;
- future target placement is not visible before its start date;
- only currently placed targets appear in school-scoped raw identity reads;
- former/future staff can still read their own identity.

