- day/week/month frequency;
- `maxPerDay`;
- preferred days as soft guidance;
- preferred times (`morning`, `midday`, `afternoon`, `evening`, `after work`, `shutdown`, `anytime`) as soft guidance;
- normal -> Minimum Done fallback when required.

Rhythms remain intentions over time rather than repeated appointment debt.

### Explainability

Scheduler-generated placements record short provenance covering:

- automatic deterministic placement;
- selected task form;
- candidate interval used;
- relevant timing constraint;
- matched explicit preference where applicable.

